<view class="page" wx:if="{{available}}">
  <view class="name serif">{{name}}</view>
  <view class="id">档案编号 {{id}}</view>

  <view class="hairline"></view>

  <view class="qr-area">
    <image wx:if="{{qr.ready}}" class="qr-image" src="{{qr.path}}" mode="widthFix" />
    <view wx:else class="qr-placeholder">{{qr.hint}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="tip">把这个码印在茶叶包装上，消费者扫码即可打开这份档案。</view>

  <view class="test-entry">
    <view class="test-title">测试查看入口</view>
    <text class="test-link" selectable>{{archivePath}}</text>
    <view class="test-actions">
      <view class="test-button primary" bindtap="onPreviewTap">直接查看档案</view>
      <view class="test-button" bindtap="onCopyLinkTap">复制测试路径</view>
    </view>
    <view class="test-note">当前档案只保存在这台设备中；复制的是开发者工具可用的页面路径，不是公网链接。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="save save-disabled" bindtap="onSaveTap">保存到相册</view>
</view>

<view class="page" wx:elif="{{loaded}}">
  <view class="unavailable serif">这份档案尚未生成</view>
  <view class="unavailable-note">请先补齐茶名、茶类、产品简介和档案主视觉，再生成档案。</view>
</view>
